   - FeatureProvider

2. Added error handling:
   - Wrapped the JSON.parse in a try-catch block
   - Added an ErrorBoundary component to catch and display any rendering errors

3. Added Suspense wrapper with a loading fallback

4. Added proper TypeScript types for the ErrorBoundary component

5. Created a QueryClient instance with some sensible defaults

